      "comment": "LAINEY BANNER (5) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (17.74) in a Grade 5 at Richmond Straight last time out. Key player on best and expected to bounce back. SPRING VELVET (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (18.29) at this track behind Midnight Fury in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can measure up. EXPLORE (1) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, most recently finishing 2nd at Bulli over 340m. Expected to be in the finish again. BIG BLUEY (2) cannot be underestimated.",
